Source: pg-nanotime
Section: database
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ruohang Feng <rh@vonng.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), postgresql-all (>= 217~)
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/bunko666-cloud/pg_nanotime

Package: postgresql-PGVERSION-pg-nanotime
Architecture: any
Provides: postgresql-pg-nanotime
Depends: ${postgresql:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Nanosecond-precision timestamp types and clocks for PostgreSQL PGVERSION
 pg_nanotime provides nanosecond-precision timestamp and interval types,
 clock functions, and monotonic clocks for PostgreSQL 17 and 18.
